        "abstract": "Dr. Ramalatha Marimuthu has worn many hats during her illustrious career spanning more than three decades. Her diverse body of work includes being an educator, researcher, entrepreneur, impact creator, mentor, and curriculum developer. A Ph.D. recipient in electrical engineering, Marimuthu seamlessly integrates her technological expertise with issues of social concern, having developed gadgets for assisting patients with neurological disorders and created systems for training children with special needs. She has also been a passionate advocate for women empowerment and workplace inclusivity.",
